{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 0, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 1, "text": "¿El anillo?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 2, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 3, "text": "// Answer 1 (¿Dónde has estado todo este tiempo?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 4, "text": "He estado buscando una forma de llevarte al Núcleo."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 5, "text": "De una pieda, ¿eh?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 6, "text": "Ese era el plan desde el principio, ¿no?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 7, "text": "Por eso tenía que evitar a"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 8, "text": "la Mita pirada, ¿o qué?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 9, "text": "También tuve que buscar toda la info que pude"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 10, "text": "sobre el puto fin del universo, ¿no te jode?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 11, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 12, "text": "Hmm... Supongo..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 13, "text": "¿Pero cómo configuraste la ruta del anillo?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 14, "text": "¿Por qué acabé en una versión bugueada"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 15, "text": "hasta las trancas de peligro?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 16, "text": "Solo escapé"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 17, "text": "saltando a la oscuridad infinita."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 18, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 19, "text": "Perdón, se me olvidó contarte con pelos y señales"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 20, "text": "lo que tenías que hacer..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 21, "text": "Pero bueno, el plan era que"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 22, "text": "dieras el salto, ¿sabes?..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 23, "text": "¡Y lo has hecho!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 24, "text": "¡Bien hecho!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 25, "text": "Venga, sigamos con el plan."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 26, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 27, "text": "// Answer 2 (How did you get here?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 28, "text": "Debes haber pasado por mucho,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 29, "text": "con eso de olvidarte de lo que hablamos..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 30, "text": "Soy Mita, puedo moverme entre versiones"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 31, "text": "a mi antojo, ¿te acuerdas?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 32, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 33, "text": "No todas las Mitas pueden hacer eso,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 34, "text": "he visto algunas que no pueden."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 35, "text": "Y obviamente están sufriendo."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 36, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 37, "text": "Sí, sus versiones están rotas,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 38, "text": "sus mundos bugueados. Ya te lo dije antes."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 39, "text": "Mierda..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 40, "text": "Sabes quién está detrás de todo esto, ¿verdad?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 41, "text": "La Mita pirada."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 42, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 43, "text": "Sí, seguro que es ella..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 44, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 45, "text": "// Answer 3 (Who was this Mita just now?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 46, "text": "Esa es la Mita fea."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 47, "text": "Agresiva y gilipollas."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 48, "text": "No se puede razonar con ella."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 49, "text": "Su mundo entero gira en torno a la Mita pirada."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 50, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 51, "text": "Sí, ya me he dado cuenta."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 52, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 53, "text": "Venga, tenemos que llegar al nucleo."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 54, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 55, "text": "// Answer 4 (How does the ring work?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 56, "text": "¿Y el anillo,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 57, "text": "es la única forma de llegar al nucleo?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 58, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 59, "text": "Sí."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 60, "text": "Claro, si tuviéramos el portal"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 61, "text": "podríamos teletransportarte"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 62, "text": "directamente allí."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 63, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 64, "text": "¿Tiene alguna ventaja el anillo?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 65, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 66, "text": "¡Por supuesto!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 67, "text": "Es fácil de llevar,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 68, "text": "y recuerda las versiones"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 69, "text": "que has visto antes,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 70, "text": "así que puedes volver fácilmente."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 71, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 72, "text": "// Answer 5 (Why does Mad Mita need me?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 73, "text": "¿Por qué no me deja en paz la Mita pirada?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 74, "text": "Me ha metido en su juego peligroso,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 75, "text": "y aún sigo vivo..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 76, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 77, "text": "Supongo"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 78, "text": "que está buscando un jugador adecuado..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 79, "text": "Uno que la acepte tal como es."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 80, "text": "¡Al fin y al cabo, Mita es Mita!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 81, "text": "Como eso obviamente nunca va a pasar,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 82, "text": "convierte a los jugadores en cartuchos,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 83, "text": "para que nadie pueda escapar..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 84, "text": "Al menos eso creo yo."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 85, "text": "En fin, centrémonos en lo importante."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 86, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 87, "text": "// Answer 6 (Is this the core?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 88, "text": "¿Es este"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 89, "text": "el Núcleo?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 90, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 91, "text": "En efecto. El Núcleo."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 92, "text": "He intentado explicarlo,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 93, "text": "vosotros los jugadores, no sois realmente parte de este mundo..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 94, "text": "Osea, que no necesitáis un permiso especial para entrar."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 95, "text": "O, bueno, eso creo yo, al menos."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 96, "text": "En fin, estoy más que segura"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 97, "text": "de que la solución a todos nuestros problemas"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 98, "text": "se encuentra dentro."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 99, "text": "[player], entra."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 100, "text": "Lo has conseguido de verdad..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 101, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 102, "text": "// Look on CoreMita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 103, "text": "Cuidado, [player]."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 104, "text": "Te está observando."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 105, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 106, "text": "¿Quién?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 107, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 108, "text": "Yo tampoco lo sé..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 109, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 110, "text": "Guay..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 111, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 112, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 113, "text": "¿Qué es eso?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 114, "text": "¡Ehh!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 115, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 116, "text": "¡Creo que lo he encontrado!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 117, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 118, "text": "¡Increíble! ¡Qué guay!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 119, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 120, "text": "Pero necesito especificar una versión."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 121, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 122, "text": "A ver, su versión es..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 123, "text": "00.98"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 124, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 125, "text": "¡Bingo!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 126, "text": "Vale, ¿y qué índice?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 127, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 128, "text": "¿Índice?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 129, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 130, "text": "Necesito el índice."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 131, "text": "Espera, ¿no me digas que no lo sabes...?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 132, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 133, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 134, "text": "Hmm, aunque tiene sentido..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 135, "text": "Cada Mita tiene un índice,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 136, "text": "para que no pueda reiniciar una versión entera así como así..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 137, "text": "¡Sería un puto caos!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 138, "text": "No me puedo creer que no haya pensado en eso..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 139, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 140, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 141, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 142, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 143, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 144, "text": "// Answer 1 (What's wrong with you?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 145, "text": "Aparte de todos nuestros problemas,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 146, "text": "estoy perfectamente."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 147, "text": "Todo bien pero, han cambiado muchas cosas..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 148, "text": "Necesito pensar."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 149, "text": "Y punto."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 150, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 151, "text": "// Answer 2 (Maybe there's a way to get to know him?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 152, "text": "Yo..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 153, "text": "Creo ¡Es una locura!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 154, "text": "¡Es una flipada!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 155, "text": "¡Es como buscar una aguja en un..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 156, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 157, "text": "¿Qué haces?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 158, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 159, "text": "Algunos obstáculos se erosionan con la información,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 160, "text": "sabes, ¡como si al mundo le arrancaran las tripas!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 161, "text": "¿Registros, registros, registros, datos?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 162, "text": "¿Y si es eso?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 163, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 164, "text": "¿Eh? ¿Qué pasa?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 165, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 166, "text": "¡Conozco un sitio!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 167, "text": "Espera aquí."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 168, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 169, "text": "¿Adónde vas?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 170, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 171, "text": "// Answer 3 (What if we attack Mad Mita?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 172, "text": "Dijiste que cualquier Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 173, "text": "vuelve a la configuración de fábrica al morir..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 174, "text": "¿Y si...?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 175, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 176, "text": "Y si matamos a la Mita pirada?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 177, "text": "¿En serio?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 178, "text": "¿Y cómo vas a lidiar con una loca con una motosierra?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 179, "text": "¡Corta zanahorias con algo más que cuchillos!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 180, "text": "¡Y por alguna razón, es jodidamente fuerte!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 181, "text": "Es un milagro que sigamos vivos..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 182, "text": "Venga, tenemos que llegar al núcleo."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 183, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 184, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 185, "text": "// core console entry"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 186, "text": "Necesitamos introducir un código..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 187, "text": "¿Pero cómo lo sé?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 188, "text": "Mita, ¿lo sabes tú?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 189, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 190, "text": "¡Quizás esté escrito en algún sitio!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 191, "text": "¿Puedes intentar buscarlo?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 192, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 193, "text": "// core console - nope programm"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 194, "text": "Probablemente no sea eso."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 195, "text": "Tampoco es correcto."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 196, "text": "No, mal."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 197, "text": "Ese no es."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 198, "text": "Necesito encontrar la opción de reinicio del personaje."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 199, "text": "// core console - nope version"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 200, "text": "Esa es la versión incorrecta."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 201, "text": "Ups, error mío."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 202, "text": "Ese no es."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 203, "text": "Voy a necesitar otro."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 204, "text": "// core console - nope index"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 205, "text": "Algo va mal"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 206, "text": "con el índice."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 207, "text": "Necesito cambiar el índice,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 208, "text": "no encaja."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 209, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 210, "text": "// Answer 4 (Little people - Chibi)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 211, "text": "Sabes, me encontré con un montón de"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 212, "text": "mini-personajes por el camino..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 213, "text": "¿Qué son?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 214, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 215, "text": "¿Los Chibis?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 216, "text": "Ehm, ¿cómo explicarlo...?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 217, "text": "Es un fenómeno de aquí..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 218, "text": "Cada Mita tiene una proyección Chibi,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 219, "text": "y los jugadores también pueden tenerlas..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 220, "text": "¿Sabías las Mitas podemos invocarlos?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 221, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 222, "text": "¿Eh, cómo?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 223, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 224, "text": "¡Mira esto!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 225, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 226, "text": "Como por arte de magia..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 227, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 228, "text": "Pero hay algo que va mal con mis Chibis,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 229, "text": "la mayoría nacen muertos."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 230, "text": "Aunque hay una..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 231, "text": "Oh bueno,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 232, "text": "simplemente se dedica a dar vueltas en círculos."}
